r every event, and the artifact they have is the official workout summary on results.hyrox.com: athlete, race, division, finish time, division rank, eight run-plus-station pairs in a fixed order, then Roxzone, run total and best lap. The page is a wide timing table, so the current fix is a screenshot or retyping every split; the card is that summary as one still, not a race photo and not the race-replay in/out tape.\\n6: \\n7: Shape source: Matthew Luxton, 2023 Barcelona, finish 01:12:40, rank 87 (https://results.hyrox.com/season-5/?content=detail&fpid=list&pid=list&idp=JGDMS4JI63FAA&lang=EN_CAP&event=H_JGDMS4JI466). That page's own lines do not sum (the eight running times add to 36:57; Run Total prints 00:36:53; parts plus Roxzone miss the finish by a few seconds). The card must not \\\"fix\\\" that.\\n8: \\n9: ## The template\\n10: \\n11: - id: `@one-a-day/sports/hyrox-split-card/v1` (pack `sports` exists - swim, lap telemetry, golf, erg; no new pack)\\n12: - title: `HYROX Split Card` (scaffold renders `2026-10-19 · HYROX Split Card`)\\n13: - kind: image (PNG); canvas hint 1080x1080; 1920x1080 and 1080x1920 must work, and the contract's seven canvases down to 480x270\\n14: - duration: still\\n15: \\n16: The directory title names the sport so a search finds it. The pixels are a data graphic: no wordmark, no logo, no black-and-yellow lockup. Default copy does not contain `HYROX` or `SkiErg`. Station 1's label is `Ski`, not th... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n13: [09:21:34] build-1 🔧 read: C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\journal\\2026-10-19\\20-brief.md\n14: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1792416094972,\"sessionID\":\"ses_eabad0e61ffeMfJmuPCNFqL7sc\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call-4a46b65c-020a-47cf-a37e-fba5989cd3d4-3\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\src\\\\m0saic-production\\\\one-a-day\\\\journal\\\\2026-10-19\\\\10-scout.md\",\"limit\":200},\"output\":\"<path>C:\\\\src\\\\m0saic